-// the speedster resolve on their own query faces until the dish and
-// takeout spines land). The ten-pull rides the AdCap gacha category with
-// the G08 T009 three-piece law: the HasCategoryBudget precheck and the
-// consumption draw the same policy instance and the same day bucket (they
