-// binds the domestic and the overseas compliance zone - switching zones never
-// loosens it) rides a rolling 24h window in the WALL-CLOCK domain (X995 law: an
-// uptime-domain window dies across sessions - the new session clock restarts near
-// zero, old capsules look future-dated, the prune condition never fires and the
-// cap silently becomes a lifetime meter, compliant but UX-dead; wall seconds keep
-// the window truly rolling across restarts). OfferAd prunes-then-caps-then-records;
-// a capped offer is a silent refusal with zero mutation outside the ad ledger and
-// the night keeps flowing untouched (E4 assertion-6: 20 offers / 0 accepted and the
-// full settlement loop still closes - no system in this inn is ever blocked by an
